tessa (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Reset inherited signal masks and ignored dispositions in every spawned
    child, including terminals, panels, layout helpers, and XWayland.
  * Publish DISPLAY only after the xwayland-satellite X socket exists, and
    leave DISPLAY/XMODIFIERS untouched when the satellite is unavailable.
  * Advertise wl_compositor v6 and notify new toplevels and layer surfaces of
    their initial fractional scale, including clients started after startup.
  * Apply output rules when an output is added, and detach tracked libinput
    device listeners during shutdown.
  * Add spawn-signal, XWayland readiness, late fractional-scale, and Kitty
    startup regression tests.
  * Expand terminal troubleshooting for Kitty EGL failures and immediate
    command exits on virtual machines.

 -- Tessa contributors <maintainers@tessa.invalid>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:45:00 +0900

tessa (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Set a default cursor at session startup and fall back to the system
    theme when a configured Xcursor theme is unavailable.
  * Add per-device libinput rules, cursor theme/size, monitor EDID matching,
    and VRR/adaptive-sync output policy.
  * Add named workspaces, a per-output scratchpad, tabbed window groups, and
    PNG wallpaper images.
  * Resolve a missing default terminal to foot/kitty/alacritty/wezterm/xterm
    instead of silently failing, and recommend a terminal in the package.
  * Depend on xcursor-themes so minimal systems have a visible pointer.
  * Include the current window-rule, layer-rule, motion, layout-helper v2,
    shell, documentation, and test updates from 0.2.

 -- Tessa contributors <maintainers@tessa.invalid>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
